          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=Phi&chapter=2&verse=23"
          ],
          "text": "ኪያሁ፡ እሴፎ፡ እፈንዎ፡ ፍጡነ፡ አእሚርየ፡ ዘከመ፡ ሀሎኩ፡ እፌንዎ፡ ሶቤሃ።"
